<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 162 0 R
/E (The objective is to develop a stochastic simulation framework to estimate glacier melt under uncertainty by generating probability distributions instead of a single value, identifying extreme scenarios, analyzing key variables, and improving accuracy and efficiency using Latin Hypercube Sampling over Monte Carlo methods.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
